units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic

lattice bcc 3.5
region box block 0 6 0 6 0 6

create_box 3 box

create_atoms 1 box basis 1 1

set type 1 type/fraction 2 0.33 12345
set type 1 type/fraction 3 0.33 54321

mass 1 24.305
mass 2 6.94
mass 3 26.9815
replicate 10 10 10

pair_style deepmd ${dp_test}
pair_coeff * * Mg Li Al

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian

fix 1 all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1

timestep 0.001

thermo 50
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press vol

dump 1 all custom 100 mglial.lammpstrj id type x y z

run 100
